   "html": "<html><body><div class=\"article-content\">\n                <div align=\"center\">\n<div align=\"left\"><font face=\"Arial\" size=\"2\"><a href=\"/sports/2008/1/21/GEN_0121085721.aspx?id=36&amp;tab=athleticfacilities\">Back to Facilities</a></font></div>\n<br>\n<font face=\"Arial\" size=\"2\"><span style=\"font-size: larger;\"><span style=\"font-size:18px;\"><strong><strong>Bradley Center Welcome Desk</strong> </strong></span><br>\n<strong><a href=\"tel:201.684.6245\">201.684.6245</a></strong></span></font>\n\n<hr size=\"2\" width=\"100%\">\n<div align=\"left\"><span style=\"font-size:14px;\"><font face=\"Arial\">A valid Bradley Center Membership ID or RCNJ ID is required in all areas of the Bradley Center. &nbsp;All schedule times are subject to change at the discretion of the Director of Athletics. Bradley Center hours are subject to change due to holidays, home varsity contests, intramural programs, and special events.</font></span></div>\n</div>\n\n<div align=\"center\">\n<hr><span style=\"color:#FF0000;\"></span>&nbsp;<span style=\"color:#FF0000;\">Active Ramapo College Students and Staff must swipe their valid ID at the Welcome Desk or they will not be permitted to enter the building.</span><span style=\"color:#FF0000;\"><br>\n<span style=\"font-size:16px;\"><strong><em>**Hours subject to change**</em></strong></span><br>\n<br>\n<span style=\"font-size:22px;\"><strong>Bradley Center Arena &amp; Lodge Fitness Center&nbsp;are&nbsp;closed until further notice.<br>\nNo one is permitted in those areas!</strong></span></span><br>\n<strong><span style=\"color:#800000;\"><span style=\"font-size:24px;\"><strong><span style=\"background-color:#FFFF00;\"></span></strong></span></span></strong>\n\n<hr><strong><span style=\"color:#800000;\"><span style=\"font-size:24px;\"><strong>2026 Fall Semester Hours</strong></span></span><br>\n<span style=\"font-size:16px;\">*subject to change*<br>\n<strong>Bradley Center, Student Lounge, and Recreation Lounge</strong></span></strong><br>\n<span style=\"font-size:16px;\">Monday - Friday - 8:00 AM -10:00 PM<br>\nSaturday - 10:30 AM - 4:30 PM<br>\nSunday - 12:00 PM - 8:00 PM</span><strong><span style=\"font-size:16px;\"><br>\n<br>\n<strong>Sharp Fitness Center (Bradley Center Weight Room)</strong></span></strong><br>\n<span style=\"font-size:16px;\">Mondays - Fridays - 8:00 AM - 9:45 PM<br>\nSaturdays - 10:45 AM - 4:15 PM<br>\nSundays - 12:15 PM - 7:45 PM</span><strong><span style=\"font-size:16px;\"><br>\n<br>\n<strong>Adele and Reuben Thomas Swimming Pool</strong></span></strong><br>\n<span style=\"font-size:16px;\">Sept. 8th - Dec. 11th, 2026<br>\nMonday - Noon - 2:00 PM<br>\nTuesday &amp; Wednesday - 10:00 AM - 2:00 PM<br>\nThursday - 11:00 AM - 2:00 PM<br>\nFriday - 10:00 AM - Noon<br>\nSaturday - 12:30 PM - 4:00 PM | Pending RCNJ varsity swim practice/meets<br>\nSunday - 12:00 PM to 4:00 PM</span><br>\n<strong><span style=\"font-size:16px;\"><br>\n<strong>Auxiliary Gym</strong></span></strong><br>\n<span style=\"font-size:16px;\">*Times may change due to team practices/events/fundraisers*<br>\nMonday - Friday:&nbsp; 8:00 AM - 9:30 AM and 11:30 AM – 12:30 PM<br>\nSundays: 12:00 PM – 4:00 PM<br>\nIf inclement weather please refer to <a href=\"https://25live.collegenet.com/pro/ramapo\" target=\"_blank\">this link</a></span><strong><span style=\"font-size:16px;\"><br>\n<br>\n<strong>Rock Climbing Wall</strong></span></strong><br>\n<span style=\"font-size:16px;\">Monday &amp; Wednesday -&nbsp; 6:00 PM - 9:00 PM</span><br>\n<strong><span style=\"font-size:16px;\"><br>\n<strong>Lodge Fitness Center Open Gym Hours</strong></span></strong><br>\n<span style=\"font-size:16px;\"><em>at the College Park Apartments</em></span><br>\n<strong><span style=\"color:#FF0000;\"><font size=\"3\">CLOSED UNTIL FURTHER NOTICE</font></span></strong><br>\n<strong><span style=\"font-size:14px;\"><br>\n<font face=\"Arial\"><font face=\"Arial\">To rent our facility, please call the Office of Events and Conferences - <a href=\"tel:201.684.7590\">201.684.7590</a></font></font></span><span style=\"font-size:16px;\"></span></strong></div>\n\n            </div></body></html>"
