\n\t\t\t\t\n\t\t\t\t\n\t\t\t</div><div id=\"game-lab-hours\" class=\"et_pb_row et_pb_row_14\">\n\t\t\t\t<div class=\"et_pb_column et_pb_column_4_4 et_pb_column_6  et_pb_css_mix_blend_mode_passthrough et-last-child\">\n\t\t\t\t\n\t\t\t\t\n\t\t\t\t\n\t\t\t\t\n\t\t\t\t<div class=\"et_pb_module et_pb_text et_pb_text_5  et_pb_text_align_left et_pb_bg_layout_light\">\n\t\t\t\t\n\t\t\t\t\n\t\t\t\t\n\t\t\t\t\n\t\t\t\t<div class=\"et_pb_text_inner\"><p style=\"text-align: center\"><strong style=\"font-weight: bold\">GAME LAB HOURS</strong></p></div>\n\t\t\t</div><div class=\"et_pb_module et_pb_divider et_pb_divider_5 et_pb_divider_position_ et_pb_space\"><div class=\"et_pb_divider_internal\"></div></div><div class=\"et_pb_module et_pb_text et_pb_text_6  et_pb_text_align_center et_pb_bg_layout_light\">\n\t\t\t\t\n\t\t\t\t\n\t\t\t\t\n\t\t\t\t\n\t\t\t\t<div class=\"et_pb_text_inner\"><p><strong>Fall Semester<br>(Aug. 26 – Dec. 15, 2026)</strong></p>\n<p>\n<strong>Mon-Thu: 9:00am – 8:00pm<br>Fri: 9:00am – 6:00pm<br>Sat &amp; Sun: <strong style=\"color: #900\">CLOSED</strong></strong></p>\n<p><strong><i>Please Note: Everyday from 11:00am – 2:00pm students in gaming classes have priority access.</i></strong></p></div>\n\t\t\t</div>\n\t\t\t</div>\n\t\t\t\t\n\t\t\t\t\n\t\t\t\t\n\t\t\t\t\n\t\t\t</div><div class=\"et_pb_row et_pb_row_15\">\n\t\t\t\t<div class=\"et_pb_column et_pb_column_4_4 et_pb_column_7  et_pb_css_mix_blend_mode_passthrough et-last-child\">\n\t\t\t\t\n\t\t\t\t\n\t\t\t\t\n\t\t\t\t\n\t\t\t\t<div class=\"et_pb_module et_pb_divider et_pb_divider_6 et_pb_divider_position_ et_pb_space\"><div class=\"et_pb_divider_internal\"></div></div>\n\t\t\t</div>\n\t\t\t\t\n\t\t\t\t\n\t\t\t\t\n\t\t\t\t\n\t\t\t</div><div class=\"et_pb_row et_pb_row_16\">\n\t\t\t\t<div class=\"et_pb_column et_pb_column_4_4 et_pb_column_8  et_pb_css_mix_blend_mode_passthrough et-last-child\">\n\t\t\t\t\n\t\t\t\t\n\t\t\t\t\n\t\t\t\t\n\t\t\t\t<div class=\"et_pb_module et_pb_text et_pb_text_7  et_pb_text_align_left et_pb_bg_layout_light\">\n\t\t\t\t\n\t\t\t\t\n\t\t\t\t\n\t\t\t\t\n\t\t\t\t<div class=\"et_pb_text_inner\">If we are offline, please email your questions to <a href=\"https://www.ramapo.edu/library/email-reference-form/\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\">refdesk@ramapo.edu</a> and we will get back to you as soon as possible.<p></p>\n<p>Please note that the front doors will be locked fifteen minutes before closing time. Circulation services will also cease at that time to give the staff a chance to perform proper closing procedures.</p></div>\n\t\t\t</div>\n\t\t\t</div>\n\t\t\t\t\n\t\t\t\t\n\t\t\t\t\n\t\t\t\t\n\t\t\t</div>\n\t\t\t\t\n\t\t\t\t\n\t\t\t</div>\t\t</div>\n\t</div>\n\t\t\t\t\t\t</div>\n\n\t\t\t\t\n\t\t\t\t</article>\n\n\t\t\t\n\n\t\t\t</div>\n<div id=\"sidebar\">\n\t\t<div id=\"text-3\" class=\"et_pb_widget widget_text\"><h4 class=\"widgettitle\">Library Hours</h4>\t\t\t<div class=\"textwidget\"><p style=\"text-align: center;\"><strong>Fall Semester</strong><br>\n<strong>(Aug. 26 – Dec. 15, 2026)</strong></p>\n<p><strong>Mon-Thu: 7:45am – 12:00am<br>\nFri: 7:45am – 6:00pm<br>\nSat: 10:00am – 6:00pm<br>\nSun: 12:00pm – 12:00am</strong><!--\n\n<hr class=\"sidebarstyle\" />\n\n\n<p style=\"text-align: center;\"><strong>Special Hours</strong></p>\n\n\n<strong>Sep 7 (Labor Day): <strong style=\"color: #900;\">CLOSED</strong>--><!--\n\n\n\n<hr class=\"sidebarstyle\" />\n\n\n<p style=\"text-align: center;\"><strong>Extended Hours (Finals)</strong>\n<strong>(May. 5 - May. 11, 2026)</strong>\n\n<strong>May 5: 7:45am - 2:00am\nMay 6: 7:45am - 2:00am\nMay 7: 7:45am - 2:00am\nMay 8: 7:45am - 10:00pm\nMay 9: 10:00am - 10:00pm\nMay 10: 12:00pm - 2:00am\nMay 11: 7:45am - 2:00am</strong>--><!--\n\n\n\n<hr class=\"sidebarstyle\" />\n\n<strong>The library/LC building will be </strong> <strong style=\"color: #900;\">CLOSED</strong> <strong> on Monday, 1/26/2026 and Tuesday, 1/27/2026, and will be operating remotely during this time.</strong>\n\n<strong><